      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at ticket #88291. Customer says their ceramic vase arrived shattered and they're demanding a refund. I see the carrier logs show no impact events during transit, which makes it look like it might've happened after delivery, but the customer is getting pretty heated.\n\nWhat's the best way to handle this so we keep our CSAT high but don't end up wasting money on bogus claims? should we just ship a new one or push back?",
